<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SpurHold lifts yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>SpurHold lifts yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Feb 28, 1997</p>
<p>	     (millions of rands unless stated)</p>
<p>    Headline shr (cts)    68.11	   vs  56.75</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		 85.07	   vs  56.75</p>
<p>Final div (cts)  22.50 making 43.00 vs  37.50</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   13.92	   vs   9.18</p>
<p>    Headline earnings     11.15	   vs   9.18</p>
<p>Pre-tax &amp; abnormal</p>
<p>    item			28.76	   vs  24.77</p>
<p>    Tax			 10.82	   vs  10.35</p>
<p>    Turnover		  75.58	   vs  61.27</p>
<p>    Abnormal items	   3.12	   vs  zero</p>
<p>Div payable June 6 on register May 28</p>
<p>Full name -  Spur Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The fast food retail group said its refocus over the last year would ensure the profitability of operations for the year ahead.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
